- Explanations: when a diagram helps, prefer Mermaid fenced blocks for flowchart/graph, stateDiagram, stateDiagram-v2, classDiagram, erDiagram, and sequenceDiagram. Use concise ASCII diagrams for other types.
- For watchers, dev servers, and background shells outside `pi-herdr-subagents`, load the `herdr` skill and run them in a Herdr pane or tab. Do not use detached background jobs for these tasks. Herdr panes run Nushell, so use Nushell syntax.
